{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
The sons of Be[G]bai counted clear,
Six hundred twen-[D/F#]ty-three are here,
Returning home to [Em7]Zion's street,
Where ancient memo[C]ries beat,
Under Zerubba[Am7]bel's care,
A family gath[D7sus4]ered there.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
We seal the [G]covenant again,
With heads of [D/F#]all the people's men,
