In Jerusalem [C]every day,
The sons of Bebai stand [Am7]and sign,
The truth that is forev[D]er thine.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Six [Am7]hundred twen-[D]ty-eight are listed,
[G]In [Dsus4]Nehemiah's [G]book that's witnessed,
